# Go to Command lists Quick Add with its key q; choosing it opens the panel on INBOX.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
END
keys :
type quick add
see Quick Add  q
hide Quick Add to
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → INBOX
type From the palette
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
	- From the palette
END
